  "description": "Not your ordinary love triangle.\nYeon-Woo's girlfriend, Ji-Yeon, leaves him without explanation. In a cooking class, Yeon-Woo meets a new friend who happens to be Su-Jin - a higher up at the company he is interning at. All seems well at first, but what happens when Su-Jin falls in love with Ji-Yeon? \n\n(Source: Manta) \n\n*Note: Includes 1 extra chapter.*",
